PURPOSE of kcov/finalize
Description: Combine coverage data for all tests and optionally generate html.

Input parameter:
    OPTIONAL: NO_HTML : if set to "true", genhtml will not be called to
        generate a coverage report. genhtml will be called for any other value
        of NO_HTML.

        If the following arguments are specified, a tgz with html and the
        coverage .info file will be uploaded to
        $NFS_SHARE/$(uname -r)/$TASKNAME/.
        If NO_HTML=="true", these are ignored:
        NFS_SHARE : an nfs share address (e.g. 10.66.12.241:/kcov)
        TASKNAME  : a dirname be created to save the file (e.g. localfs or nfs
                    or cifs)
